1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:01,559
Smells so good.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,599
Smells good.

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,640
Is it hotpot?

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,360
Hotpot!

5
00:00:05,361 --> 00:00:08,560
Hotpot! My spicy hotpot!

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,480
My spicy hotpot.

7
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:11,600
Let's go.

8
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,320
Smells amazing.

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,320
Smells good.

10
00:00:16,321 --> 00:00:17,639
I'm already drooling.

11
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:20,119
Congratulations, everyone, on completing the Second Exam.

12
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,319
So, as a reward for everyone,

13
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,799
we prepared hotpot.

14
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,760
Let me give a thank you.

15
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:24,480
Thanks.

16
00:00:24,481 --> 00:00:26,199
So you actually took Sun Mingyang's suggestion.

17
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:26,920
Thank you, everyone.

18
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:27,800
My suggestion was adopted.

19
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:28,480
I'm so happy.

20
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,400
That's amazing.

21
00:00:29,401 --> 00:00:30,559
Okay, I'll guess.

22
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,160
He's going to play a game again.

23
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,519
So while everyone is eating,

24
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,879
we've also prepared for everyone

25
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,320
Hotpot Werewolf Game.

26
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,000
Help! We have to play a game.

27
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,200
We have to do it ourselves again.

28
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,999
In each round, among the eight players, there will be one Werewolf.

29
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,999
The Werewolf can use a specific action to attack others.

30
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,759
After the Werewolf attacks, the production team will wait a certain amount of time

31
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,239
to announce who has been eliminated.

32
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,999
I'll say, "Somebody, you're a out."

33
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,039
Then you can't eat or talk.

34
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,040
After "killing" three people,

35
00:00:57,041 --> 00:00:58,119
review and vote someone out.

36
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,239
If it's a Werewolf, then the game ends.

37
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,240
If the Werewolf isn't voted out,

38
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,080
we continue the game.

39
00:01:01,081 --> 00:01:02,119
After the Werewolf kills another person,

40
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:03,000
we'll move on to the review.

41
00:01:03,001 --> 00:01:05,039
The Werewolf only needs to stay hidden until only two people remain, and then he wins.

42
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,359
If the Werewolf is voted out, the Villager side wins.

43
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,599
The Villager side will be awarded one point.

44
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,239
If the Werewolf wins, they get three points.

45
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,000
Let's hand out the role cards first.

46
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:23,919
It's you, right?

47
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,879
Alright, everyone close your eyes.

48
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,560
Werewolf, open your eyes.

49
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,400
Werewolf, confirm your action.

50
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,839
Okay, everyone open your eyes.

51
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,480
Let's serve the first round of dishes.

52
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,760
The game can start now.

53
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,720
Go easy on me.

54
00:01:50,721 --> 00:01:52,999
Let us take a couple bites first, thanks.

55
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,920
I'm really getting a bit too hungry.

56
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,160
Is this supposed to be cooked?

57
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,199
This thing is cold, isn't it?

58
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,479
I don't know.

59
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,880
He said it's supposed to be cooked.

60
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,360
Right now, I don't dare to talk to anyone.

61
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,479
I can only talk to myself now.

62
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:35,639
I guess this crispy pork is probably supposed to be cooked.

63
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,640
Don't all look at me.

64
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:38,760
I just want to eat.

65
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,959
Guys, actually I'm the Werewolf.

66
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,480
I'm a Werewolf.

67
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,480
I am.

68
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,600
Okay, Jiang Xiaomeng, you're a out.

69
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:04,920
What?

70
00:03:04,921 --> 00:03:06,759
Xiaomeng has been blocking here the whole time.

71
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:07,600
Come on, show humanity.

72
00:03:07,601 --> 00:03:09,719
Why? He's always alone.

73
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,879
He's practically hiding himself away.

74
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:13,159
So do you think the Werewolf kills by making anyone

75
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:15,639
who doesn't speak within five minutes die automatically?

76
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,799
Come on, show humanity.

77
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,359
Because Xiaomeng is the only one who hasn't spoken.

78
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,360
Very likely.

79
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,919
And he hasn't made eye contact with anyone.

80
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,240
How did he suddenly get "killed"?

81
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,840
Why?

82
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,520
The luncheon meat is ready.

83
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:39,599
This is a gentleman's game.

84
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,960
I'm afraid I won't get any.

85
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,560
Jiang Xiaomeng, can you pour me a cup?

86
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,800
You're the only one I trust now.

87
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:53,880
What? I'll help.

88
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:54,520
I can only trust you now.

89
00:03:54,521 --> 00:03:55,600
Ziyu, out.

90
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,839
Who contacted you?

91
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,359
Big Ma.

92
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,839
No, I asked Xiaomeng to pour it for me.

93
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,840
It's Big Ma.

94
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,120
When Ziyu was "killed",

95
00:04:04,121 --> 00:04:06,359
I was watching them do actions to each other.

96
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,120
And Ziyu just got "killed."

97
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:07,960
Right.

98
00:04:07,961 --> 00:04:09,519
Either Big Ma or Ruijian.

99
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,520
It's not me.

100
00:04:10,521 --> 00:04:12,120
Why are you randomly voting people out?

101
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,840
It's so hot.

102
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,840
Not cooked.

103
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,120
I'll sacrifice myself.

104
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:24,840
Come on, Big Ma.

105
00:04:24,841 --> 00:04:26,279
What did you say you want me to do?

106
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,120
Stand up.

107
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,120
Come on, stand.

108
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,839
Sit down, look me in the eye.

109
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:30,440
What else?

110
00:04:30,441 --> 00:04:31,639
What instructions do you have?

111
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,360
You give the orders.

112
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,560
I command you.

113
00:04:33,561 --> 00:04:34,599
Take a taxi home.

114
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,199
It definitely won't be that simple.

115
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,519
Stupid question.

116
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,800
Okay, Zhou Guorui, out.

117
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,760
Just now, Guorui and Mingyang

118
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,519
just did some gestures to each other.

119
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,239
If I get "killed" next,

120
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,319
Mingyang is the one who "kills".

121
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,839
Come on, whatever you tell me to do, I'll do it.

122
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,520
If I'm dead, it's gotta be you.

123
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,480
Whatever you ask me to do, I'll do it.

124
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,480
You stand up first.

125
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:57,800
You sit down.

126
00:04:57,801 --> 00:04:58,961
Okay, I stand up, I sit down.

127
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,120
It's not you at all.

128
00:05:00,121 --> 00:05:01,879
When the two of us did that action,

129
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,640
Ziyu just got "killed."

130
00:05:02,641 --> 00:05:04,519
Before Ziyu was "killed", I hadn't said a single word to him.

131
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,400
But I can only say Sun Mingyang probably isn't.

132
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,799
Otherwise, I wouldn't have tried so hard to prove myself.

133
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,199
Because he was standing with Zhang Ziyu.

134
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:09,720
When Zhang Ziyu was "killed",

135
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,560
he didn't look over there at all.

136
00:05:10,561 --> 00:05:11,799
I could see the two of them.

137
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,320
Right.

138
00:05:12,321 --> 00:05:13,959
Maybe he was making a move.

139
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,800
Right.

140
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,640
Was it you?

141
00:05:15,641 --> 00:05:16,759
What move did I make?

142
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,999
You didn't say anything just now.

143
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,159
But I just glanced at you,

144
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,239
and then immediately looked back.

145
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,959
Then I couldn't have killed you.

146
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,319
I think the suspect is now between

147
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,799
you and Ruijian.

148
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,919
I think it's Ruijian.

149
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,359
Then let's vote Ruijian first.

150
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,360
Let's vote. Come on.

151
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,680
Come on, three, two, one, vote.

152
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,559
Okay, Wang Ruijian, Out.

153
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,919
Game continues.

154
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,199
Are you guys dummies?

155
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,600
Why did you vote for me again?

156
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,799
Sorry, then it's Big Ma.

157
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,999
Don't have any contact with Big Ma this round.

158
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,839
It's not Weixian. I think it's Guanyu.

159
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:46,039
What do you think my motive is?

160
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,520
Your motive

161
00:05:46,521 --> 00:05:47,559
is that you're the Werewolf

162
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,800
and you need to "kill" someone.

163
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,160
I have a feeling,

164
00:05:51,161 --> 00:05:52,359
the next one should be me.

165
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,040
So the game has started now, right?

166
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,359
I know who it is.

167
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,320
It's okay, you guys discuss.

168
00:05:58,321 --> 00:05:59,639
I've been watching Guanyu.

169
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:02,199
It's Guanyu.

170
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,439
Guanyu just did that to you.

171
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:03,960
Like this.

172
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:04,720
I did this to him.

173
00:06:04,721 --> 00:06:06,079
But he wasn't "killed".

174
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:06,680
You then asked.

175
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,560
After you finished this,

176
00:06:07,561 --> 00:06:09,599
you turned back and asked, "Has it started?"

177
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,320
I really trust you.

178
00:06:10,321 --> 00:06:11,879
I've been staring at him.

179
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,599
I'm telling you, if he's "killed", it's Weixian.

180
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,480
I tell you.

181
00:06:14,481 --> 00:06:15,639
Then I'll watch Weixian. I'll keep an eye on him.

182
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,200
If you get "killed", it's him.

183
00:06:16,201 --> 00:06:17,321
If I get "killed", it's him.

184
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,280
Our eyes right now...

185
00:06:26,281 --> 00:06:27,640
Okay, Chen Zhixuan, out.

186
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,640
It's Guanyu.

187
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,880
It's Guanyu.

188
00:06:33,881 --> 00:06:36,319
Weixian was pretty normal this time, even though he winked at me.

189
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,039
That wink was you.

190
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,159
You're putting on a show again.

191
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:42,079
Excuses. I'll give you room to make excuses.

192
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,239
I didn't.

193
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:47,719
I have nothing to argue about.

194
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,439
Hurry up and vote.

195
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,440
Come on.

196
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,440
Come on, Guanyu is number one.

197
00:06:51,441 --> 00:06:52,600
Three, two, one.

198
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,920
Okay, Guanyu, out.

199
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,959
So, are you the Werewolf?

200
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,319
After I put my foot out,

201
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,760
whoever I point to is who I "kill."

202
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,360
What a smell.

203
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:07,479
Pointing at people with your foot?

204
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,320
Pointing at people with your foot.

205
00:07:08,321 --> 00:07:10,319
That's really something, man.

206
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,999
Such a stink, such a stink.

207
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,160
How are we supposed to eat?

208
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,320
At the time, I thought to myself.

209
00:07:16,321 --> 00:07:18,919
"Are you crazy? You're just having a meal, why are you taking off your shoes?"

210
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,200
Do you want to drink?

211
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,800
Can we have a little to drink?

212
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:34,359
I can understand you doing something this insane.

213
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,159
So how did you

214
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,000
point at me with your toes?

215
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,919
Come, watch me.

216
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,319
Step one, take off your shoes.

217
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,399
Step two, move your foot back.

218
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,400
Step three.

219
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,319
So creepy.

220
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,880
Don't show me your feet.

221
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,840
Thank you, Director,

222
00:07:49,841 --> 00:07:50,960
for letting me have a meal.

223
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,919
I've noticed in this game, Werewolves can keep eating.

224
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,519
Right, I want to be a Werewolf.

225
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,280
I want to be a Werewolf too.

226
00:07:57,281 --> 00:07:59,321
Next, I will look at each person's feet one by one.

227
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,600
Don't take off your shoes.

228
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,280
Come on, next round.

229
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,480
Things don't go as one wishes.

230
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:08,800
Don't "kill" me.

231
00:08:08,801 --> 00:08:10,319
I want to eat a little longer.

232
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,560
Come on, everyone close your eyes.

233
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,800
Okay, Werewolves, open your eyes.

234
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:24,760
Okay, Werewolves, please confirm your orders.

235
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:26,960
Okay.

236
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,200
Werewolves, close your eyes.

237
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,359
Everyone, open your eyes.

238
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,280
The game can begin.

239
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:34,559
I'm guarding my brain and my tripe.

240
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:35,560
I'll leave it to you.

241
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,639
But this brain takes a long time to cook, dear.

242
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,640
But I'm afraid it'll fall apart.

243
00:08:38,641 --> 00:08:40,519
Because everyone will keep stirring it around later.

244
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,279
But don't you have to stay here for ten minutes?

245
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,280
Sorry.

246
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,800
Then I'll...

247
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,640
Mingyang, be careful.

248
00:08:46,641 --> 00:08:48,359
I'll prop it up here.

249
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,600
So it doesn't fall apart later.

250
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:52,520
What are you doing?

251
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,840
I'm watching your feet.

252
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,840
Be careful.

253
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,719
This round it shouldn't be feet.

254
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,720
Xiaomeng, eat this.

255
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,720
This is delicious.

256
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:14,160
Okay, Sun Mingyang, out.

257
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:19,240
Finally, I'm not the first one.

258
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,400
Don't look at me.

259
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,840
Look me in the eyes.

260
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,679
Why do you keep coming over?

261
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,959
I'll just sit here and eat.

262
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,440
What do you want? What are you doing?

263
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,376
When something is out of the ordinary, there's something fishy.

264
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:38,720
Okay.

265
00:09:38,721 --> 00:09:39,959
The three of us are eating together.

266
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,320
Come on.

267
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,200
Even if we're not Werewolves,

268
00:09:41,201 --> 00:09:42,639
we keep an eye on the two people next to us.

269
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:44,200
And one of you keep an eye on me, okay?

270
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,256
The production team is watching you.

271
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,599
Right, Xiaomeng, you keep an eye on me.

272
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,600
I won't watch.

273
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:50,720
So sad, so upset.

274
00:09:50,721 --> 00:09:51,880
You'll kill me first.

